      "text": "/auth: Generates a session ID and sets it as Cookie,\nvalidates roomId and Turnstile's token generating a\nJWT with displayName, roomId, expiry time (6 hours),\nand Cookie + User Agent + IP (hashed with SHA256).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "aximpYS9BcWU1iGWIWAkc",
      "originalText": "/auth: Generates a session ID and sets it as Cookie, validates roomId and Turnstile's token generating a JWT with displayName, roomId, expiry time (6 hours), and Cookie + User Agent + IP (hashed with SHA256).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
